{"id":"spannung","lemma":"Spannung","pos":"noun","rank":3811,"glosses":["voltage","tension","suspense (emotion of anticipation, excitement, anxiety or apprehension)"],"ipa":"/ˈʃpanʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/7e/De-Spannung.ogg/De-Spannung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Spannung","plural":"Spannungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich vermisse die Spannung.","en":"I miss the excitement.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to miss","l":"vermissen"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Spannung liegt in der Luft.","en":"There's excitement in the air.","words":[null,{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"air, atmosphere"}]},{"text":"Die Spannungen zwischen den beiden Ländern wachsen.","en":"Tensions are growing between the two countries.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"between"},{"g":"the","l":"der"},{"g":"both","l":"beide"},{"g":"country","l":"Land"},{"g":"to grow"}]},{"text":"Die Spannung bringt mich noch um!","en":"The suspense is killing me.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to bring","l":"bringen"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"around / at"}]},{"text":"Dem Spiel fehlte es an Spannung.","en":"The game lacked excitement.","words":[{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},{"g":"a game"},{"g":"for there to be a lack…","l":"fehlen"},{"g":"it"},{"g":"at / on"},null]}]}